Nova TV — third-party credits
=============================

Indflix (https://github.com/dipender98/Indflix)
-----------------------------------------------
Parts of this app are ported from Indflix, licensed under the
GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0):

  app/src/main/java/com/anees/novamobile/data/sources/vegamovies/
      VmHttp.kt            ← VegamoviesPlugin.kt (HTTP layer, domain healing, search index)
      VegamoviesSource.kt  ← VegamoviesPlugin.kt (search → detail → link selection)
      FuzzySearch.kt       ← FuzzySearch.kt (title matching / ranking)
      LinkNaming.kt        ← LinkNaming.kt (quality & season/episode parsing)
      NexdriveResolver.kt  ← NexdriveResolver.kt (gateway → fastdl / vcloud expansion)
      VcloudResolver.kt    ← VcloudResolver.kt (double-atob token chain → r2 stream URLs)

  app/src/main/java/com/anees/novamobile/data/sources/indstream/
      IndStreamSources.kt  ← IndStream StreamEngine.kt (NetMirror, Braflix, VaPlayer resolvers)
                             + ServerRegistry.kt (endpoint templates)
  app/src/main/java/com/anees/novamobile/data/sources/multimovies/
      MultimoviesSource.kt ← Multimovies MultimoviesPlugin.kt (V2 search, watchConfig servers,
                             domain resolver, embed unwrapping) + ExternalSources.kt (ModiPlay)

Each ported file carries a provenance header naming the original source file
and describing the adaptations.

Adaptations: CloudStream-specific code (SearchResponse/LoadResponse/ExtractorLink,
CloudflareKiller, MetadataService, SettingsUi) was not ported; HTTP goes through
OkHttp with coroutine cancellation instead of CloudStream's `app.get`.

